{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked inside an abandoned mental asylum, you become part of a disturbing experiment designed to test perception, patience, and resolve.<br>The asylum\u2019s silent corridors demand careful observation and methodical problem-solving \u2014 every puzzle brings you closer to understanding what this place truly is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras/1d4d56e72e7faeb2239b2a2a62e72aad.avif?t=1768339410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras_big/1d4d56e72e7faeb2239b2a2a62e72aad.avif?t=1768339410 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, reality begins to fracture.<br>You are pulled into distorted, dreamlike spaces where the rules feel less stable and the threat more immediate. In these moments, survival depends on staying unnoticed and moving carefully, as something searches for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras/a03f337898e25d41c8f54915df5edba3.avif?t=1768339410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras_big/a03f337898e25d41c8f54915df5edba3.webp?t=1768339410 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These contrasting spaces reflect the experiment itself: moments of calm reasoning interrupted by pressure and disorientation. Only by going through both can you piece together the truth behind the asylum \u2014 and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience focuses on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and puzzle-solving within the asylum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-driven sequences set in unsettling, dreamlike locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal guidance and a slow-burn atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a slow-paced, atmospheric experience focused on puzzles, exploration, and tension rather than combat or reflex-based gameplay.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027820?t=1768339410","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027820?t=1768339410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/e88adb69e0d60c73f380e57b0aa555cabddd3df1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768339410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/e88adb69e0d60c73f380e57b0aa555cabddd3df1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768339410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"You are locked in an abandoned insane asylum and are hunted by an aggressive doctor."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked inside an abandoned mental asylum, you become part of a disturbing experiment designed to test perception, patience, and resolve.<br>The asylum\u2019s silent corridors demand careful observation and methodical problem-solving \u2014 every puzzle brings you closer to understanding what this place truly is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras/1d4d56e72e7faeb2239b2a2a62e72aad.avif?t=1768339410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras_big/1d4d56e72e7faeb2239b2a2a62e72aad.avif?t=1768339410 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, reality begins to fracture.<br>You are pulled into distorted, dreamlike spaces where the rules feel less stable and the threat more immediate. In these moments, survival depends on staying unnoticed and moving carefully, as something searches for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras/a03f337898e25d41c8f54915df5edba3.avif?t=1768339410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/extras_big/a03f337898e25d41c8f54915df5edba3.webp?t=1768339410 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These contrasting spaces reflect the experiment itself: moments of calm reasoning interrupted by pressure and disorientation. Only by going through both can you piece together the truth behind the asylum \u2014 and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience focuses on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and puzzle-solving within the asylum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-driven sequences set in unsettling, dreamlike locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal guidance and a slow-burn atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a slow-paced, atmospheric experience focused on puzzles, exploration, and tension rather than combat or reflex-based gameplay.</i></p>","developers":["Silent Clock Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/2768e86c518c93f68aac0ca2f0898d93f7aa515d/header.jpg?t=1768339410","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027820/1972581752/ebbeda3553d28ca9f887ae2f997f6c9926b77210/1766964984/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766965570","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027820/1972581752/ebbeda